      "prompt": "A polygon has 6 sides. 5 of its interior angles are each 133°, and the remaining interior angle is (3x + 7)°. Find x.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Sum of interior angles = (n - 2) × 180 = (6 - 2) × 180 = 720°",
        "Sum of the 5 equal angles = 5 × 133 = 665°",
        "Remaining angle = 720 - 665 = 55°",
        "3x + 7 = 55",
        "Subtract 7 from both sides:",
        "3x = 48",
        "Divide both sides by 3:",
        "x = 16"
